   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Recreational Cannabis Dispensary Near Sandwich, MA 02563"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Cape Cod Cannabis is a Wellfleet, MA-based (adult-use ’21+’) recreational cannabis dispensary (cannabis store) that proudly serves customers from Sandwich, MA 02563 02667.</p><p><em><strong>Looking for a top-rated recreational cannabis dispensary near Sandwich, MA 02563?</strong></em> Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet is your go-to destination for premium cannabis on Cape Cod. Whether you’re a local or just visiting, we offer the <b>largest selection of high-quality cannabis products at the best prices on the Cape</b>.</p><p>Located just a scenic drive from West Harwich, our dispensary is stocked with <b><a href=\"/categories/flower/\">premium flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">potent pre-rolls</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">flavorful edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">powerful concentrates</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vapes</a>, and more</b>. Our knowledgeable and friendly staff are here to guide you toward the perfect product for your desired effects—whether you’re seeking relaxation, creativity, focus, or fun.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Why Make the Trip from Sandwich, MA 02563 to Cape Cod Cannabis?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ol><li>✅ One of the <b>best recreational dispensaries on Cape Cod</b></li><li><p>✅ Competitive prices with rotating <em>daily</em><a href=\"/specials/\"><b> Blazing Bargains &amp; Bundles</b></a></p></li><li><p>✅ A largest curated menu of <b>the finest</b> and <b>top-tier brands at the best prices on Cape Cod</b></p></li><li><p>✅ Quick, convenient <b>online ordering &amp; in-store pickup</b></p></li><li><p>✅ Welcoming, <b>judgment-free shopping experience</b></p></li></ol><p>Whether you’re gearing up for a beach day, hitting the bike trails, or relaxing after exploring Cape Cod, Cape Cod Cannabis has exactly what you need to elevate your experience. <em><strong>It’s worth the trip!</strong></em></p><p><em>Check out our <a href=\"/menu/\">extensive online cannabis menu</a> (and below) and place your pre-order today!</em></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "We Value Our Sandwich, MA 02563 Customers"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Cape Cod Cannabis proudly serves the Sandwich, MA 02563 community handling all cannabis needs. Check out our reviews to see what your Sandwich, MA 02563 neighbors are saying about us!</p>"
    },
