   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Visiting Cape Cod Cannabis"
    },
    {
     "t": "divider"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Conveniently located in a shopping plaza along the State Highway Route 6 we offer plenty of designated and municipal parking and a wide variety of premium cannabis products and other brand merchandise.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "button",
     "label": "Get Directions",
     "href": "/directions/"
    },
    {
     "t": "icon"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Parking"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>For your convenience, we have 26 dedicated parking spaces. Several municipal parking spaces are located in the shopping plaza at no charge as well.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "icon"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Payment"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>We accept cash, debit cards, and Can Pay. ATM is available on site. ATM and Debit transactions have a $3.50 merchant fee.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "icon"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Online Pre-Orders"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>You can place an order online, set the time of pick-up, and quickly pick up your order. </p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "icon"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Knowledgable Staff"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>To guide you through the process and consult you on your cannabis needs.</p>"
    }
   ]
